# Normalise line endings to LF in both the repository and the working tree.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts get CRLF while the Linux CI runner gets LF,
# and `prettier --check` (which pins endOfLine: lf) passes in one place and
# fails in the other. Pinning the working tree removes that whole class of
# false failure.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.db     binary
*.wasm   binary
*.ico    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.woff2  binary
